     1034   PROCEDURE adm-update-record :
     1035       MESSAGE
     1036         "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1037           "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Update.":U
     1038             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
